  "body": "## Summary\n\n- fix `setup_env.py` so `run_command(..., log_step=None)` only exits on actual subprocess failures\n- add focused regression coverage for success, failure-without-log-step, and failure-with-log-step paths\n- keep the patch limited to the Python bootstrap helper without touching model conversion or kernel code\n\n## Validation\n\n- `python3 -m py_compile setup_env.py tests/test_setup_env_run_command.py`\n- `python3 -m unittest tests.test_setup_env_run_command`",
